name: mule_layering_ring
title: "Money-mule layering ring"
description: "A money-laundering ring hidden among about 1,800 ordinary transfers between accounts. Twelve accounts each pay small cash deposits, just under the reporting threshold, into one hub account; the hub passes almost all of it on within hours through two relay accounts to an offshore account, and four shell companies send money round in a loop. Each link is the transfers from one account to another by one channel; a thicker link means more transfers. Suspicion score puts the hub first, and Communities sets the ring apart from the ordinary traffic."
sourceId: entity-projection
layout: force
profile: finance
query:
  projection:
    datasetId: mule_transfers_dataset
    sourceCol: PAYER_ACCOUNT
    targetCol: PAYEE_ACCOUNT
    linkKindCol: CHANNEL
    attrCols[1]: PAYEE_COUNTRY
view:
  legend: true
  workingSet: true
  plugins:
    minimap: true
    hulls: true
    behaviors[1]: hover-activate
